{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_112fc3d9ce852c49e1cc2794e4a6a31e0acf5162e45d91509c84e9cd1da42a9f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_28280400b7b87aca6be90789eec86ae08e92ce373594db06afbeb616055d12d4","slc_65c80ff173795739d240f3821f05318dd3ff062be2357f1cecdbf1b39840af5a","slc_6ebb4148db1938fe52c8960db7afc037722c6d3201f7591b2cc1bc44a06f337f","slc_7838117742749d74f17d3761922d3c367c24c4df5c48b96ff05e103e87e1dd0a"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"Repository development practice: build and run with 'dotnet build' then 'dotnet run --project CodingAgentExplorer'; publish via publish.bat (Windows) or bash publish.sh (macOS/Linux) into a gitignored Published/ directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_15f3990fb8a930384735f5d4d8363949fc738965e66188bcdcd3a1139c862b60","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_494b118c1f9db385f3ececa9e7d0171d62a3bc3354f98e303dca0ce15385d8dc","slc_cdea50477cf24ff744d8c3a20c610c57a8f1ea009358e38fd798a4cb84563985"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"HookAgent is a companion CLI used as a Claude Code hook command: it reads a JSON payload from stdin, collects Claude environment variables, POSTs to the dashboard's /api/hook-event endpoint, and relays exitCode/stdout/stderr back.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2f36d62d4ed3c19aed46cee8d8374062e6431f183eff730991124ce7a7601a91","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2a2a09dca7d2b56c391727bd84d44a50c7d1905c703d540933ec4390ab6706a7","slc_2c94e7dca6057526c87010785900135bf0d17fe9b2cce8beba281599973e7756","slc_e1581a31d6e003e17a0c4c6b479b6e1d56c22b2bd431f5e9901e43d30e37ea1b"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f","src_9930a9445ce75614bbe568d29e0e9012"],"text":"The MCP Observer acts as a transparent proxy on port 9999 between Claude Code and any HTTP-based MCP server, with the destination URL configured at runtime via a dashboard page.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_579dec6d2009efef92f3f6c1c09f2945cb56f07b4d608ffca444720fcf2b26cb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3b46ebe6336a342a3ba91ba6353db7d35953325845c9a1be4a1ae0879c449c5c"],"source_ids":["src_9930a9445ce75614bbe568d29e0e9012"],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md imposes a writing style rule for documentation, forbidding em dashes and dashes as sentence separators in README.md and other docs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5808aef265d2b075d3a69bf5e5b24db221ad5aa012b83866a7126bebdaed059c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13f154350f049989401bffd7eedbf89e30d213b714b17bf5c1e3f8496a5f9f41","slc_6222e22f57257e446b3dc5fb64b6b1ab85991a315619234cea058ca289efed51"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"The dashboard exposes three views: HTTP Inspector (table of proxied requests with headers, bodies, SSE events, timing), Conversation View (chat-style timeline), and MCP Observer.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5a4ce8633bf5bfc9a61c36f2a8c0f2c83863e985fe33fd316642463746a6db43","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_393d8156319103a2dcb1bf1ff69400634b72877254c8bc026e23d038463c0ec8","slc_494b118c1f9db385f3ececa9e7d0171d62a3bc3354f98e303dca0ce15385d8dc"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"HookAgent exits silently with code 0 when the dashboard is not running, so it never blocks Claude Code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_791dfcc0cf71e770528e6616582349dae29b4438246c69c6b41b500426f7eafb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_423487f9c1df8d305b14f651eeb78898aa9ae4fb7980e0d820136e4c84b7ec9c","slc_53fae10ebab79906e9ddf87c2eb9b8f8e0fa2e92ee4441d16a2b304ab42a4c98"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f","src_9930a9445ce75614bbe568d29e0e9012"],"text":"Captured data is held in memory only: a circular buffer capped at 1000 requests for API traffic, plus in-memory stores for hook events and MCP requests (max 500), with no persistence.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_84c037f3ba48863afadefb13f7bf72a3210b2c482ccac708b0dc52ce06328fd5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ec5d4174dc4cc331ee77f7fd0613debfb292a75643f50bef1fa42d56fd925146"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"The tool currently supports Claude Code with the Anthropic API only; support for additional coding agents may be added in the future.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ae14e7c49873ebf6842aeae4f02799a9b5d72bb8cde7216292918866b2f1d38e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31e47201d193ef7acb3ca482ebea4cc26fa44fbedd6d667705a49231a78c1128"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"The project was built as a teaching tool for AI-agent workshops, helping developers understand what happens under the hood when AI coding agents work.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c74b8dd5f97bbf4ea2462ba86411efe02d2fabf596d7639f2bb9c77acdc2faf6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_53fae10ebab79906e9ddf87c2eb9b8f8e0fa2e92ee4441d16a2b304ab42a4c98"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"API keys in x-api-key and Authorization headers are automatically redacted from stored request data, and the proxy listens only on localhost.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cf1f1562b7de53c4cb5ff4fd1726fb60b48f2149d8f9948c543f8f7ebabd49d0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_72ba9ec2c19acf0570ae2c8f9f89d2bfc292ea626ee78a536643cadbe7601d9e","slc_fe8beacaa962d385d089992aa3abdfab5f3eb1019d51dbce5ed2add88139d465"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"The tool runs four localhost endpoints: reverse proxy on 8888, MCP proxy on 9999, and dashboard on 5000 (HTTP) and 5001 (HTTPS, auto-launching a browser on Windows).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e657275eb07badb388230cec2064cbfadacf50c477151585e467255fc5ce2fe6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_205b8145cd74d612de0c8c766e341277d1d20b546e19aaa34d87defb0e6be98e"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"The architecture uses ASP.NET Core with YARP reverse proxy, SignalR for real-time dashboard updates, a vanilla HTML/JS/CSS frontend with no build step, and a single NuGet dependency (Yarp.ReverseProxy).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e7b85008fafe429202bf14cddc449be828a58f162b7b499b869efe51d6bf4b21","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"tndata/codingagentexplorer@e70b2cc5213e snapshot b9b610683b980106","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5616d4aaea41b3a10929033966eafdb7669f711e61fac825b12d9f781f3f5456","slc_d2750f82e978876a52ff3e06de5e4e7bb2465dddc2e78dce08ee6c7a4dc8cb6c"],"source_ids":["src_178c5b380e9453228c8a490ec215927f"],"text":"The project requires the .NET 10 SDK (or later) to build, and published outputs require the .NET 10 runtime on the target machine.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45c46896e5c942bb95d4cd12b20b6b1e"}
